# Themezur Advanced Header Roadmap

The Themezur child theme header must become a full advanced store header. **All items below are required over time** — do not treat unfinished items as optional ideas.

## Done

- 3-row header (top / middle / bottom) with panel colors + typography
- Logo from Themezur panel (not Customizer)
- Social icons repeater (multi-network)
- Date or custom right-side text
- Scroll behavior: shrink / bottom sticky / transparent→solid
- Categories mega dropdown (WooCommerce product categories)
- Smart search: product-only AJAX live suggestions
- Dismissible announcement bar (cookie + version key)
- Per-element mobile / desktop visibility controls
- Conditional headers (Home / Shop / Blog overrides + deeper assignment scopes)
- Account / login icon (WooCommerce My Account, WP login fallback)
- Phone / hotline in top bar (tel: link)
- Spacing / height / container width controls (Header → Layout)
- Multi-promo rotating messages on top bar
- Cart AJAX count via WooCommerce fragments
- Wishlist / Compare icons (URL + YITH wishlist auto-detect)
- Header presets (Midnight / Clean Light / Amber Store)
- Scroll progress line

## Still required

_(none — advanced header roadmap complete)_

## Rules when extending header

- Every new feature: Themezur admin controls + Help/Docs accordion entry
- Prefer single `themezur_options` autoloaded option
- Keep Alpine only on admin; frontend stays vanilla/light
- WooCommerce features degrade gracefully when WC is inactive
